# Behind `left instanceof Word` the field is not read off a Count, which lacks it: the sum that a new Word holds is a string. A test of another value says nothing: there the sum may be of undefined.
# f2 = twice
# RUN: walk f2 mechanisms=all
# CHECK-LABEL: code f2:Body
# CHECK: = Add {{*}}form=Strings
# RUN(ANSWERS): run-in-shell mechanisms=all
# ANSWERS: ab abab 1 true
# ANSWERS-NEXT: NaN cc far
# ANSWERS-NEXT: exited with 0
# RUN(NONE): run-in-shell mechanisms=none
# NONE: ab abab 1 true
# NONE-NEXT: NaN cc far
# NONE-NEXT: exited with 0
